{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_04BE80","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"还有恐龙变成僵尸袭击人类的传说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"僵尸？你是说<R=活死人,LIVING DEAD>！？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=活死人,LIVING DEAD>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"嗯。就算恐龙灭绝了，也可能作为僵尸复活。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"等等。先不说是不是恐龙，僵尸这种东西本来就不存在于现实。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"清醒点啊，Boss！海地的种植园很早以前就让僵尸干活了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"海地自古就流传着一种叫“僵尸粉”的秘药。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"……是吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"肯定是古代人用僵尸粉把恐龙变成了僵尸。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不，人类诞生的时候，恐龙早就已经……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"那肯定是这个前提本身就错了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"……总之，那只恐龙似乎强得惊人。它叫Gear REX，据说怎么杀都杀不死。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"还有说法称，被它的体液溅到的人会像被烧伤一样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"还有，从它背上掉下来的棘刺会与咆哮共鸣，让人痛苦不堪……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"……它会不会只是一只特别强大的怪物？恐龙的生命力，本来就不是人类能够想象的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"就算用步枪之类的武器打上几枪，也未必会死……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"你怕僵尸吗，Boss？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":25,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"……没那回事。我只是不相信而已。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""}]}